      "id": "claim_a11595c05afb4d6684e552d4c01d92be",
      "statement": "V5__article_extracted_content.sql adds a nullable article.extracted_content TEXT column that caches the reader-view readable-HTML extraction result; it is populated on first extraction via ArticleRepository.saveExtractedContent and is not present in earlier schema versions.",
      "evidence": [
